---
import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro"
import { Image } from "astro:assets"

import imgRoom from "~/content/projects/flareup/Arthur_Pohlit_NYU_1014.jpg"
import imgRoom2 from "~/content/projects/flareup/Arthur_Pohlit_NYU_1007.jpg"
import imgExtraction from "~/content/projects/flareup/Arthur_Pohlit_NYU_1591.jpg"
import imgMap from "~/content/projects/flareup/Arthur_Pohlit_NYU_1585.jpg"
import img4Up from "~/content/projects/flareup/Arthur_Pohlit_NYU_1582.jpg"

import imgPortrait1 from "~/content/projects/flareup/Arthur_Pohlit_NYU_0982.jpg"
---

<Layout
  title="Flareup"
  img="https://lachlanjc.com/projects/flareup.webp"
  className="flex flex-col gap-12 md:gap-24"
>
  <style is:global>
    :root {
      --active-hue: #e59406;
    }
  </style>

  <section class="grid md:grid-cols-2">
    <header
      class="pt-4 pb-8 md:py-20 container mx-auto max-w-xl px-4 prose prose-h1:text-6xl prose-a:no-underline prose-a:weight-medium"
    >
      <a
        href="/"
        class="text-xl font-triple block md:-mt-12 py-4 font-mono-slabs transition-transform hover:-translate-x-6"
      >
        &larr; @lachlanjc
      </a>
      <h1 class="mb-0">Flareup</h1>
      <p>
        U.S. Democrats legalized the export of American fossil gas overseas in
        2017, beginning a massive industrial buildout of export terminals, along
        Cancer Alley in the Southeast but increasingly up the East Coast as
        well. The export of American gas increases energy prices for Americans,
        increases pollution in poor communities, and profits flow to only a few
        corporations. New research reveals the carbon impact of exporting gas is
        worse than burning coal, but the gas buildout is sold as a “climate
        solution” for our allies.
      </p>
      <p>
        While studying abroad in Berlin in fall 2025, I researched the results
        of the Ukraine war on European energy supplies and began unraveling this
        story. I created an interactive projection show, displayed for the
        <strong style="color: #ec008c">Fingerfertigkeiten</strong> opening in the
        St. Agnes gallery in Berlin in December 2023. Thank you to Arthur Pohlit
        for the show photography.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://flareup.vercel.app">
          Explore the interactive (desktop only) &rarr;
        </a>
      </p>
    </header>
    <Image
      src={imgPortrait1}
      alt="Whole project"
      class="max-h-screen w-auto md:ml-auto"
    />
  </section>

  <Image
    src={imgRoom}
    alt="Wide shot of Lachlan in front of projection of map of U.S. L.N.G. terminals"
  />

  <Image
    src={imgMap}
    alt="Close-up of map with caption: I grew up in a small college town in the Northeastern U.S."
  />
  <Image src={imgExtraction} alt="Extraction banner" />
  <Image src={img4Up} alt="Grid of L.N.G. tankers" />
  <Image
    src={imgRoom2}
    alt="Wide shot with fracking infrastructure photos projected"
  />
</Layout>
